<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Aaliyah" data-copy-zh="Aaliyah">Aaliyah</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Aaliyah at the KTV entrance and check the venue’s late-night hours." data-copy-zh="在 KTV 入口找到 Aaliyah，查清深夜营业时段与当前可用互动。">Find Aaliyah at the KTV entrance and check the venue’s late-night hours.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 8 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 8 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Aaliyah at the KTV</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where and when</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Meeting her</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">What is available</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">If you cannot find her</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">KTV 门口的 Aaliyah</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里、几点能见到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">初次见面</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">当前可以做什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">找不到她时</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Aaliyah at the KTV</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Aaliyah — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aaliyah.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Aaliyah — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aaliyah.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Aaliyah — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Aaliyah welcomes guests at the KTV entrance in the Present. She is a late-night ambient contact, so a visit is a chance to meet her while exploring Downtown.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>Where and when</h2><p>Go to <strong>Present → Downtown → KTV</strong>. Aaliyah is there every day from <strong>20:00 to 01:59</strong>, across midnight. The venue uses the same opening hours.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Meeting her</h2><p>Enter during opening hours and select Aaliyah’s portrait. Her appearance has no separate affection, story or recruitment requirement.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>What is available</h2><p>She offers ambient greetings. There is no personal Talk or gift menu, romance chain, Heart-to-Heart, skill lesson or recruitable-worker role. KTV date invitations belong to the venue and your invited partner.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>If you cannot find her</h2><ul><li>Check the clock: 02:00–19:59 is outside her shift.</li><li>Look at the entrance rather than the private karaoke room.</li><li>An empty personal-action list is expected; buying gifts does not open a route.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">Locations — Downtown and KTV</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships and dating — inviting a partner</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>KTV 门口的 Aaliyah</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Aaliyah 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aaliyah.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Aaliyah 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/aaliyah.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Aaliyah 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Aaliyah 在现代的 KTV 门口迎接客人。逛市中心时，可以在深夜营业时段来认识她。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_Her"></span><h2>在哪里、几点能见到</h2><p>前往<strong>现代 → 市中心 → KTV</strong>。她每天<strong>20:00–次日 01:59</strong>都在，KTV 也按这一时段营业。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>初次见面</h2><p>营业时进入 KTV，选择 Aaliyah 的头像即可。她的出现没有额外的好感、剧情或招募条件。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>当前可以做什么</h2><p>她会显示日常问候，没有个人交谈或送礼菜单，也没有恋爱任务链、谈心、技能教学或员工招募。KTV 的约会邀请属于场所与受邀伴侣的活动。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>找不到她时</h2><ul><li>先看时间：02:00–19:59 不在她的班次内。</li><li>在入口找她，不是在 KTV 包间。</li><li>个人行动列表为空是正常情况；购买礼物不会开启后续路线。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="locations.html">地点：市中心与 KTV</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系与约会：邀请伴侣</a></li></ul></section>
